  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Woroyire Onion Producers&apos; Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Onion..Beneficiaries: 1119 smalls farmers (710 women)..UD SCOOP-P.O/Woroyire seeks to expand onion producers revenues through better access to inputs, production infrastructures (storage warehouse, garden wells) and equipments (motor pumps, protection kits, etc.) and training.</narrative>
  </description>
